{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cardinal Descent is an addictively complex roguelike deckbuilder where you play element based hands against powerful enemies, create your own rules and discover outrageous synergies. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Master the Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically play element based cards to pull off combos of your choosing. With over 50 sub types of cards within each suit, and over 100 game changing Space Cards.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/master-the-elements.gif?t=1745483733\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Change the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every rule of each element is controlled by a card, meaning you can change exactly how each each suit behaves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/change_the_game.gif?t=1745483733\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Break The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock cards over multiple runs and strategically build your deck around specific strategies to maximize your abilities and pull off absurd combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/break_the_game.gif?t=1745483733\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3114100?t=1745483733","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3114100?t=1745483733","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/4b3c835dda476adbaff9fa719fca8db101d5bda7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745483733","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/4b3c835dda476adbaff9fa719fca8db101d5bda7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745483733","categories"